    <node id="palette_drift">
      <data key="d0">Three Contradictory Color Systems (brand drift)</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">BRAND-GUARDIAN-LANDING-AUDIT-2026-09-04.md</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Brand book describes teal/ochre; shipped product is navy/red (tokens.css + design-tokens.json); a third design-tokens.json claims to be source of truth but matches neither. Repo will not converge without an owner decision.</data>
      <data key="d4">24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="met_mentor_scoring_fidelity">
      <data key="d0">MET Scoring Fidelity Gap (0-80 scaled)</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">AUDIT-MET-MENTOR-2026-08-19.md</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Platform reports raw %-correct, not official 0-80 scaled score; three divergent CEFR calculators disagree (one invents C2, outside MET's A2-C1 scope). Official: 0-39 A2, 40-52 B1, 53-63 B2, 64-80 C1.</data>
      <data key="d4">54</data>
    </node>
    <node id="frontend_infinite_loop">
      <data key="d0">C1 Infinite Render Loop (order sentences)</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">FRONTEND-AUDIT-2026-09-02.md</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Root cause: effect depends on `update` arrow function recreated every render (not memoized); syncing derived state via effect is the root mistake; correct fix is to call update explicitly from move().</data>
      <data key="d4">24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="frontend_form_labels">
      <data key="d0">C2 Orphaned Form Labels</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">FRONTEND-AUDIT-2026-09-02.md</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">FormField renders &lt;label&gt; as sibling of children with no htmlFor/id association across 44 usages — WCAG 1.3.1 / 4.1.2 failure; fixed by generating id via useId and grafting onto child via cloneElement.</data>
      <data key="d4">24</data>
    </node>
    <node id="brand_guardian_testimonials">
      <data key="d0">P0 Invented Testimonials (real hospitals)</data>
      <data key="d1">document</data>
      <data key="d2">BRAND-GUARDIAN-LANDING-AUDIT-2026-09-04.md</data>
      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Nurse first names likely fictional but hospital names are real (Hospital das Clínicas, Albert Einstein, Sírio-Libanês); fabricated band gains + score claims violate guidelines' ban on unverified statistics and real-institution endorsement.</data>
      <data key="d4">24</data>
    </node>
