      <data key="d3" />
      <data key="d10" />
      <data key="d11" />
      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Keep the human part visible: writing and speaking feedback stays in the teacher's hands and is applied 'when it counts' (sample: Ms. Johnson reviewed a listening main-idea task, May 12 2026).</data>
      <data key="d4">92</data>
