      <data key="d12" />
      <data key="d13" />
      <data key="d14">Static practice mock test 3 of the MET B2 platform. Four sections: Reading &amp; Grammar (50Q/65min), Listening (30Q/50min), Speaking (5 tasks/10min), Writing (2 tasks/45min); total ~2h55m. Answers persist in localStorage (met:answers:v2, met:reading3, met:listening3, met:speaking3, met:writing3) and submit via Netlify form 'met-submission' plus /api/save-submission.</data>
      <data key="d4">48</data>
    </node>
